The public half of the key storm releases are signed with.
Storm has its own release key (made 2026-10-18 with EveSynapse's
releasesign keygen): the private half is the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY
Actions secret on this repo, with the owner's backup copy in his
offline storage. The release workflow refuses to sign with a key
whose public half is not listed here. Only public keys belong in
this file.

